  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Minority and Indigenous Peoples Collective</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to support advocacy on behalf of minorities to ensure meaningful achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) and foster a better, more sustainable future and the full enjoyment of human rights for Minority and Indigenous Peoples  in East Africa, as well as the recognition of their role and their greater involvement in combatting climate change. It aims to achieve this through strengthening governance and accountability towards access to quality education, health, and other basic services (e.g. power, water, internet, roads, housing) and to increase access  to judicial and non-judicial remedies to challenge violations of Minority and Indigenous Peoples&apos; rights to land, personal property, and personal safety.</narrative>
  </description>
